"image_alt":null,"column_type":null,"width":"50","image_width":null,"image_height":null,"content_item_id":null,"content_item_type":null},{"id":839,"title":"Celebrating Excellence content","content":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>At DPS Jankipuram<o:p><\/o:p><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">We believe every achievement\u2014big or small\u2014is a step towards\r\ngreatness. \u201cCelebrating Excellence\u201d is our way of acknowledging the hard work,\r\ndetermination, and talent of our students and teachers. From academic achievements\r\nand sports victories to cultural brilliance and community service, every\r\nsuccess story adds to the rich tapestry of our school\u2019s journey. By celebrating\r\nexcellence, we not only honor the achievers but also inspire others to pursue\r\ntheir dreams with the same dedication and spirit.<o:p><\/o:p><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Excellence deserves to be celebrated, we take pride in\r\nshowcasing the achievements of our vibrant community. Our students shine in\r\nacademics, sports, cultural pursuits, innovation, and leadership\u2014bringing\r\nlaurels not only to the school but also to themselves and their families. Every\r\nrecognition fuels greater confidence, while every milestone sets a higher\r\nbenchmark for the future. Through these celebrations, we nurture a culture of\r\nmotivation where success is valued and new possibilities are encouraged.<o:p><\/o:p><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Every accomplishment is a moment of pride. Be it a medal on\r\nthe sports field, an award on the stage, or an innovation in the classroom, we\r\ncelebrate the spirit of excellence in every form. Recognizing the achievements\r\nof our students and teachers is not just about applause\u2014it is about encouraging\r\na lifelong pursuit of learning, creativity, and growth. Success is sweeter when\r\nit is shared, honored, and used as an inspiration for greater heights<o:p><\/o:p><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">We celebrate the success of our students, teachers, and the\r\nentire school community with pride and enthusiasm. Our recognition extends\r\nacross academics, sports, cultural events, innovation, and social\r\nresponsibility, ensuring that every achievement is valued. These celebrations\r\nfoster a sense of belonging, strengthen motivation, and instill in our students\r\nthe belief that with effort and perseverance, excellence is always within\r\nreach.<o:p><\/o:p><\/p>","content_type":"text","image_path":null,"image_url":null,"link_url":null,"video_path":null,"video_url":null,"table_data":null,"accordion_data":null,"order":1,"is_active":true,"created_at":"2025-09-23T08:53:14.427000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-26T05:49:29.743000Z","page_section_id":"2234","content_heading":"Celebrating Excellence content","alignment":null,"image_alt":null,"column_type":null,"width":"50","image_width":null,"image_height":null,"content_item_id":null,"content_item_type":null}]}]}}